---

description: Data/content rules for templates, stages, and balance
globs: ["wipshmup2/scripts/**/*.gd", "wipshmup2/config/**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---

# Templates and Data
- Enemies/Bosses/Stages are data-driven; keep logic generic and params in data.
- Use config files (JSON/CFG) for tunables; avoid hardcoding numbers.

# Balance
- Respect difficulty scaling and rank pressure system; expose multipliers via config.
- Keep early-stage difficulty accessible; scale density/speed via rank.

# Serialization Safety
- Use safe defaults when fields are missing; never crash on bad data.